I board the bus to go home.
It is raining heavily outside.
It will rain in the evening.
The weather app said so.
Now a strong wind blows.
Rainwater comes inside the bus through the window.
A passenger pulls down the metal window.
I also help him.
I close the window near my seat too.
The other passengers also close the windows quickly.
The metal windows are very heavy.
Now rainwater is not coming inside.
It is very cool inside the bus.
It is generally very hot in Kochi.
It is very sunny during the daytime.
But now it is raining heavily.
I like this coolness very much.
It is very dark outside.
The bus continues its journey.
I sit happily near the window.
